 "remarks": "Welcome to a truly exceptional New Canaan architectural masterpiece built in 2004, nestled on a majestic private lane occupied by only 6 estates, enveloped by serene forests and 48 acres of reservoir conservancy. This picturesque estate offers a tranquil escape and sense of openness with intricate millwork and wainscoting adorning every corner, 9 to 12-foot ceilings on every level and sun-drenched spaces throughout. Spanning over 11,000 square feet, with an additional 4,000SF+ lower level, with 6 bedrooms, 7.2 baths on 4.7 acres with room to add a custom pool, step inside to discover a seamless blend of ultimate privacy and modern luxuries throughout 4 finished levels. Immerse yourself in the serenity just 5 minutes to downtown New Canaan and an hour to NYC, where luxury and tranquility converge in perfect harmony.",
